## Objective

The objective of this feature is to allow recruiters to
view applications submitted for their company's job and
internship postings.

The feature establishes the applicant-management workflow
for later shortlisting, rejection, status updates and
interview scheduling.

---

## Features

- View applications for company opportunities
- View application IDs and statuses
- Associate applications with opportunities
- Restrict access to the recruiter's company
- Prepare the applicant list for resume viewing
- Display an empty state when no applications exist

Resume viewing requires integration with the project's
actual resume storage field or URL.

